==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Furious Fists|Hypno|36}} from the {{TCG|Furious Fists}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Hypno}}.
*'''Sleep Pendulum''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Poké-Power}} on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Hypno|H12}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*'''Psypunch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Hypno|9}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

